```gitignore
# ============================================================
# Logs
# ============================================================
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*


# ============================================================
# Dependencies
# ============================================================
node_modules/


# ============================================================
# Build & Framework Output
# ============================================================
dist/
dist-ssr/
.output/
.vinxi/
.tanstack/
.nitro/


# ============================================================
# Environment & Local Configuration
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
*.local

# Allow example environment files
!.env.example


# ============================================================
# Wrangler / Cloudflare
# ============================================================
.wrangler/
.dev.vars


# ============================================================
# Cloudflare Tunnel
# Generated tunnel configuration / credentials
# ============================================================
cloudflared.yml
*-credentials.json


# ============================================================
# Editor / IDE Files
# ============================================================
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

.idea/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?


# ============================================================
# Temporary / Scratch Files
# ============================================================
scratch_docx/
scratch_docx_extracted.txt


# ============================================================
# Documentation / Audit / Planning Files
# ============================================================
AGENTS.md
AUTH-AUDIT-SUMMARY.md
AUTH-SECURITY-AUDIT.md
DEPLOYMENT_OPTIMIZATION.md
F0-AUDIT-REPORT.md
FRONTEND-API_OVERVIEW.md
IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md
IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md
IMPLEMENTATION-STATUS.md
PHASE-0-CHECKLIST.md
PHASE-1-COMPLETE.md
PHASE-1-IMPLEMENTATION.md
SIGNUP-LOGIN-TEST-REPORT.md
WHATSAPP-AUTOMATION_GUIDE.md
WhatsApp_CRM_Master_Feature_Wise_Implementation_Roadmap.docx


# ============================================================
# Archives / Large Generated Files
# ============================================================
whatsapp-dashboard-backend.zip
```

**Important:** If files such as `node_modules`, `.env`, `dist`, or the documentation files were already committed to Git, this `.gitignore` alone won't remove them from tracking.

Run:

```powershell
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git status
```

Then:

```powershell
git commit -m "fix gitignore"
git push
```

This will re-evaluate the entire repository against the new `.gitignore`.
